"s1\">くれぐれも頑張りすぎないようにね！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">頑張りすぎちゃった時は自分を最大限に</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">甘やかしてくださいね</span><span class=\"s3\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">￣∀￣</span><span class=\"s3\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ちなみに私は頑張った日はご褒美にアイスを食べるんだ</span><span class=\"s2\">🍦😋</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">明日はきっしーです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">それでは</span><span class=\"s3\">12</span><span class=\"s1\">日後にまた会おう〜</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">まったねー！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style